      "account_lock_summary": "A player account commits to exactly one realm identity for the current product phase. Sub-characters inherit that realm and share same-realm account storage.",
      "selection_warning_meaning": "The confirmation warning must communicate durable allegiance without implying a paid transfer, partial reset, or story-supported realm change exists.",
      "uncommitted_meaning": "Before commitment, realm browsing is preview-only and must not grant resources, Realm Gems, territory, quest state, or chapter eligibility.",
      "committed_meaning": "After commitment, the realm identity becomes the source for inner-realm presentation, sub-character filtering, realm-specific naming, and NVS eligibility checks.",
